# Error Handling Guide for Frontend

## Tổng quan

FE đã được cập nhật để xử lý error messages từ Backend một cách rõ ràng và nhất quán. Tất cả error messages từ BE đều theo cấu trúc `BaseResponse`:

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Invalid email or password",
  "errorCode": "INVALID_CREDENTIALS",
  "timestamp": "2026-03-04T10:30:00Z",
  "path": "/v1/auth/login"
}
```

## Error Handler Utility

Một utility mới được tạo tại `src/utils/errorHandler.ts` để giúp dễ dàng trích xuất và log error messages.

### Available Functions

#### 1. `getErrorMessage(error, defaultMessage)`
Trích xuất user-friendly error message từ error object.

```typescript
import { getErrorMessage } from '@/utils/errorHandler';

try {
  await login({ email, password });
} catch (err) {
  const errorMsg = getErrorMessage(err, 'Login failed');
  setError(errorMsg); // Hiển thị "Invalid email or password"
}
```

**Thứ tự ưu tiên:**
1. Kiểm tra `error.response.data.message` (từ BaseResponse)
2. Kiểm tra `error.response.data.data.message` (nested data)
3. Kiểm tra `error.response.data.error` (alternate field)
4. Kiểm tra `error.message` (generic error)
5. Dùng default message

#### 2. `getErrorCode(error)`
Trích xuất error code từ response.

```typescript
import { getErrorCode, isErrorCode } from '@/utils/errorHandler';

try {
  await register(...);
} catch (err) {
  if (isErrorCode(err, 'DUPLICATE_EMAIL')) {
    // Handle duplicate email specifically
  }
}
```

#### 3. `extractErrorInfo(error)`
Trích xuất toàn bộ error information.

```typescript
import { extractErrorInfo } from '@/utils/errorHandler';

try {
  await login(...);
} catch (err) {
  const { message, code, status, fullResponse } = extractErrorInfo(err);
  console.log(`Error ${code}: ${message} (Status: ${status})`);
}
```

#### 4. `logError(source, error, context)`
Log error với format nhất quán.

```typescript
import { logError } from '@/utils/errorHandler';

try {
  await someOperation();
} catch (err) {
  logError('MyComponent.operation', err, { userId: 123 });
  // Output:
  // [MyComponent.operation] Error: {
  //   message: "...",
  //   code: "ERROR_CODE",
  //   status: 400,
  //   context: { userId: 123 },
  //   fullError: {...}
  // }
}
```

## Cập nhật trong Các File

### Login.tsx
- Import `getErrorMessage` và `logError`
- Sử dụng `logError` để log error details
- Sử dụng `getErrorMessage` để trích xuất error message

```typescript
import { getErrorMessage, logError } from '@/utils/errorHandler';

const handleLogin = async () => {
  try {
    await login({ email, password });
  } catch (err: any) {
    logError('Login', err, { email });
    const errorMsg = getErrorMessage(err, 'Login failed');
    setError(errorMsg);
  }
};
```

### Register.tsx
- Import `getErrorMessage` và `logError`
- Sử dụng `logError` để log error details
- Sử dụng `getErrorMessage` để trích xuất error message

```typescript
import { getErrorMessage, logError } from '@/utils/errorHandler';

const handleSubmit = async (e: React.FormEvent) => {
  try {
    await register(...);
  } catch (err: any) {
    logError('Register', err, { email });
    const errorMsg = getErrorMessage(err, 'Registration failed');
    setError(errorMsg);
  }
};
```

### Profile.tsx
- Import `logError`
- Sử dụng `logError` trong try-catch block

```typescript
import { logError } from '@/utils/errorHandler';

const fetchUserProfile = async () => {
  try {
    const response = await apiService.user.getMe();
    setProfile(response.data.data);
  } catch (error) {
    logError('Profile.fetchUserProfile', error);
  } finally {
    setIsLoading(false);
  }
};
```

### AuthStore.ts
- Import `logError`
- Sử dụng `logError` trong login và register functions

```typescript
import { logError } from '@/utils/errorHandler';

login: async (credentials) => {
  try {
    // ... login logic
  } catch (error) {
    set({ isLoading: false });
    logError('AuthStore.login', error, { email: credentials.email });
    throw error;
  }
},

register: async (name, email, password, role) => {
  try {
    // ... register logic
  } catch (error) {
    set({ isLoading: false });
    logError('AuthStore.register', error, { email, role });
    throw error;
  }
},
```

## Console Output Examples

### Login Error
```
[Axios Request] POST http://localhost:8080/v1/auth/login
{url: "/v1/auth/login", headers: {...}}

[Axios Response Error] {
  status: 401,
  url: "/v1/auth/login",
  message: "Request failed with status code 401",
  data: {
    success: false,
    message: "Invalid email or password",
    errorCode: "INVALID_CREDENTIALS",
    ...
  }
}

[Login] Error: {
  message: "Invalid email or password",
  code: "INVALID_CREDENTIALS",
  status: 401,
  context: { email: "test@example.com" },
  fullError: {...}
}
```

### Register Error
```
[Register] Error: {
  message: "Email đã tồn tại, vui lòng dùng email khác!",
  code: "DUPLICATE_EMAIL",
  status: 409,
  context: { email: "test@example.com" },
  fullError: {...}
}
```

## Best Practices

1. **Luôn log error** - Sử dụng `logError()` để log error details để dễ debug
2. **Trích xuất message** - Sử dụng `getErrorMessage()` để lấy message từ BE
3. **Hiển thị cho user** - Hiển thị message rõ ràng trên UI
4. **Thêm context** - Truyền context thông tin vào `logError()` để giúp debug (email, userId, etc.)
5. **Handle error codes** - Sử dụng `isErrorCode()` để xử lý specific error types

## Error Codes từ Backend

| Error Code | HTTP Status | Mô tả |
|---|---|---|
| INVALID_CREDENTIALS | 401 | Email hoặc password không đúng |
| DUPLICATE_EMAIL | 409 | Email đã tồn tại trong hệ thống |
| INVALID_REFRESH_TOKEN | 401 | Refresh token không hợp lệ |
| USER_NOT_FOUND | 404 | User không tìm thấy |
| LOGOUT_FAILED | 500 | Logout thất bại |
| TOKEN_GENERATION_FAILED | 500 | Tạo token thất bại |

## Testing Error Handling

Khi test, hãy mở Console (F12) để xem:
1. Axios request/response logs
2. Error message trích xuất
3. Full error details

Ví dụ:
```
// Test login with invalid credentials
Email: test@example.com
Password: wrongpassword

// Expected console output:
[Axios Request] POST http://localhost:8080/v1/auth/login
[Axios Response Error] status: 401, message: "Invalid email or password"
[Login] Error: message: "Invalid email or password", code: "INVALID_CREDENTIALS"

// Expected UI:
Error message displayed: "Invalid email or password"
```

import { useState, useEffect } from 'react';
import { useNavigate } from 'react-router-dom';
import { Button } from '@/app/components/ui/button';
import { Card } from '@/app/components/ui/card';
import { Input } from '@/app/components/ui/input';
import { Label } from '@/app/components/ui/label';
import { motion } from 'motion/react';
import { Mail, Lock, AlertCircle, Loader2 } from 'lucide-react';
import { useAuthStore } from '@/store/authStore';
import { getErrorMessage, logError } from '@/utils/errorHandler';

export function Login() {
  const navigate = useNavigate();
  const { login, isLoading, user, isAuthenticated } = useAuthStore();
  const [email, setEmail] = useState('');
  const [password, setPassword] = useState('');
  const [error, setError] = useState('');

  // Redirect if already authenticated
  useEffect(() => {
    if (isAuthenticated && user) {
      console.log('[Login] User already authenticated, redirecting to dashboard:', user.role);
      const dashboardRoute = user.role === 'teacher' ? '/teacher' : user.role === 'admin' ? '/admin' : '/';
      navigate(dashboardRoute, { replace: true });
    }
  }, [isAuthenticated, user, navigate]);

  // Navigate when user is set after login
  useEffect(() => {
    console.log('[Login] useEffect triggered, user:', user, 'navigate:', navigate);
    if (user && !email) {  // Only navigate if login was just completed (no email in form)
      console.log('[Login] User found, navigating to role:', user.role);
      // Determine dashboard route based on user role
      let dashboardRoute = '/';
      if (user.role === 'teacher') {
        dashboardRoute = '/teacher';
      } else if (user.role === 'admin') {
        dashboardRoute = '/admin';
      }

      // Navigate to appropriate dashboard
      navigate(dashboardRoute, { replace: true });
    }
  }, [user, navigate, email]);

  const handleLogin = async () => {
    setError('');
    if (!email || !password) {
      setError('Please enter both email and password');
      return;
    }

    try {
      console.log('[Login] Attempting login for:', email);
      await login({ email, password });
      console.log('[Login] Login successful, state should update user');
    } catch (err: any) {
      console.error('[Login] Login error:', err);

      // Extract error message from BE response
      // BE response format: { success: false, message: "...", errorCode: "...", ... }
      let errorMsg = 'Login failed';

      if (err.response?.data) {
        const responseData = err.response.data;
        // Try message field first (from BaseResponse)
        if (responseData.message) {
          errorMsg = responseData.message;
        }
        // Try nested message in data object (if exists)
        else if (typeof responseData.data === 'object' && responseData.data?.message) {
          errorMsg = responseData.data.message;
        }
      } else if (err.message) {
        errorMsg = err.message;
      }

      console.error('[Login] Error message:', errorMsg);
      console.error('[Login] Full error response:', err.response?.data);
      setError(errorMsg);
    }
  };

  const demoUsers = [
    { role: 'student', email: 'student@demo.com', color: 'bg-green-500' },
    { role: 'teacher', email: 'teacher@demo.com', color: 'bg-blue-500' },
    { role: 'admin', email: 'admin@demo.com', color: 'bg-purple-500' },
  ];

  return (
    <div className="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 via-blue-50 to-purple-50 dark:from-gray-900 dark:via-gray-900 dark:to-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
      <div className="max-w-5xl w-full">
        <motion.div
          initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}
          animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
          transition={{ duration: 0.5 }}
          className="text-center mb-8"
        >
          <div className="flex justify-center mb-6">
            <div className="flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-green-400 to-green-600 text-white font-bold shadow-2xl text-3xl">
              E
            </div>
          </div>
          <h1 className="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            Welcome back!
          </h1>
          <p className="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
            Sign in to continue your learning journey
          </p>
        </motion.div>

        <div className="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          {/* Demo Users */}
          <motion.div
            initial={{ opacity: 0, x: -20 }}
            animate={{ opacity: 1, x: 0 }}
            transition={{ delay: 0.3 }}
          >
            <h2 className="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">
              Quick Login Demo
            </h2>
            <div className="space-y-3">
              {demoUsers.map((demo, index) => (
                <Card
                  key={demo.role}
                  className="p-4 cursor-pointer transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-green-500"
                  onClick={() => {
                    setEmail(demo.email);
                    setPassword('password123');
                  }}
                >
                  <div className="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div className={`h-10 w-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold ${demo.color}`}>
                      {demo.role[0].toUpperCase()}
                    </div>
                    <div className="flex-1">
                      <h3 className="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white capitalize">{demo.role}</h3>
                      <p className="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">{demo.email}</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </Card>
              ))}
            </div>
          </motion.div>

          {/* Login Form */}
          <motion.div
            initial={{ opacity: 0, x: 20 }}
            animate={{ opacity: 1, x: 0 }}
            transition={{ delay: 0.3 }}
          >
            <Card className="p-8">
              <form onSubmit={(e) => { e.preventDefault(); handleLogin(); }} className="space-y-6">
                <div>
                  <Label htmlFor="email">Email</Label>
                  <div className="relative mt-2">
                    <Mail className="absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-5 w-5 text-gray-400" />
                    <Input
                      id="email"
                      type="email"
                      placeholder="your@email.com"
                      value={email}
                      onChange={(e) => setEmail(e.target.value)}
                      className="pl-10 rounded-xl"
                      disabled={isLoading}
                    />
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <Label htmlFor="password">Password</Label>
                  <div className="relative mt-2">
                    <Lock className="absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-5 w-5 text-gray-400" />
                    <Input
                      id="password"
                      type="password"
                      placeholder="Enter your password"
                      value={password}
                      onChange={(e) => setPassword(e.target.value)}
                      className="pl-10 rounded-xl"
                      disabled={isLoading}
                    />
                  </div>
                </div>

                {error && (
                  <motion.div
                    initial={{ opacity: 0, y: -10 }}
                    animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
                    className="flex items-center gap-2 p-3 bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-900/20 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-800 rounded-xl text-red-600 dark:text-red-400"
                  >
                    <AlertCircle className="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0" />
                    <p className="text-sm">{error}</p>
                  </motion.div>
                )}

                <Button
                  size="lg"
                  disabled={isLoading}
                  className="w-full bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-600 text-white rounded-xl py-6 text-lg shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all"
                  onClick={handleLogin}
                >
                  {isLoading ? (
                    <>
                      <Loader2 className="mr-2 h-5 w-5 animate-spin" />
                      Signing in...
                    </>
                  ) : (
                    'Sign In'
                  )}
                </Button>

                <div className="text-center">
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    onClick={() => navigate('/register')}
                    className="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 hover:underline"
                  >
                    Don't have an account? Register
                  </button>
                </div>
              </form>
            </Card>
          </motion.div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}

import { useState, useEffect } from 'react';
import { useNavigate } from 'react-router-dom';
import { Button } from '@/app/components/ui/button';
import { Card } from '@/app/components/ui/card';
import { Input } from '@/app/components/ui/input';
import { Label } from '@/app/components/ui/label';
import { motion } from 'motion/react';
import { Mail, Lock, AlertCircle, Loader2 } from 'lucide-react';
import { useAuthStore } from '@/store/authStore';
import { getErrorMessage, logError } from '@/utils/errorHandler';

export function Login() {
  const navigate = useNavigate();
  const { login, isLoading, user, isAuthenticated } = useAuthStore();
  const [email, setEmail] = useState('');
  const [password, setPassword] = useState('');
  const [error, setError] = useState('');

  // Redirect if already authenticated
  useEffect(() => {
    if (isAuthenticated && user) {
      console.log('[Login] User already authenticated, redirecting to dashboard:', user.role);
      const dashboardRoute = user.role === 'teacher' ? '/teacher' : user.role === 'admin' ? '/admin' : '/';
      navigate(dashboardRoute, { replace: true });
